		<xs:documentation>Draft V1.3.2 edited on October 21, 2004. by Laurie Kern (BearingPoint)</xs:documentation>
	</xs:annotation>
	<xs:annotation>
		<xs:documentation>Draft V1.3.3 edited on Novenber 11, 2004. by Laurie Kern (BearingPoint)</xs:documentation>
	</xs:annotation>
	<xs:annotation>
		<xs:documentation>RC V1.0.0 edited on December 03, 2004 by Laurie Kern (BearingPoint)</xs:documentation>
	</xs:annotation>
	<xs:annotation>
		<xs:documentation>RC V1.0.1 edited on 28 February 2005 by Laurie Kern (BearingPoint)</xs:documentation>
	</xs:annotation>
	<xs:annotation>
		<xs:documentation>RC V1.0.2 edited on 08 March 2005 by Laurie Kern (BearingPoint)</xs:documentation>
	</xs:annotation>
	<xs:annotation>
		<xs:documentation> V1.1 edited on 28 April 2005 by Chaithanya Kadiyala (BearingPoint)</xs:documentation>
	</xs:annotation>
	<xs:annotation>
		<xs:documentation> V1.2edited on 26 Oct 2005 by Chaithanya Kadiyala (BearingPoint)</xs:documentation>
	</xs:annotation>
	<xs:annotation>
		<xs:documentation>Modified: 5 Dec 2005 Version: 2.0.0 Author: Mark Johnson (Carter Ground Fueling).  This version contains a number of amendments based on discussions at the Miami meeting  (29-30 November 2005). The version number has been updated to 2.0.0 following major changes to the schema.  It will now reference 2 additional schemas (1 contains the Fuel Code Directory and the other contains the Base Data Type Directory).</xs:documentation>
	</xs:annotation>
	<xs:annotation>
		<xs:documentation>Modified: 12 Jan 2006 Version: 2.0.1 Author: Mark Johnson (Carter Ground Fueling).  
		Amended to reference non-versioned dependency files.
		Amendment to filename to remove version numbering.
		</xs:documentation>
	</xs:annotation>
	<xs:annotation>
		<xs:documentation>Modified: 24 Feb 2006 Version: 2.0.2 Author: Mark Johnson (Carter Ground Fueling).  
		SubInvoiceIDState type increased to 50 characters from 25 to bring into line with documentation
		</xs:documentation>
	</xs:annotation>
	<xs:annotation>
		<xs:documentation>Modified: 26 Jun 2007 Version: 3.0.0  Author: Guido Peetermans (IATA).  
		Various changes as agreed by Fuel Data Standards Group
		</xs:documentation>
	</xs:annotation>
	<xs:annotation>
		<xs:documentation>Modified: 09 May 2008 Version: 3.0.1  Author: Jean-Christophe Rossand (IATA).  
		Minor updates compared to 3.0.0:
		   - Declaration of the element ItemDeliveryReferenceValue corrected
		   - Comment added: Recommendation that each implementation should update manually the schemaLocation for Base Datatype and Fuel Directory, and that spaces should be avoided in the Schema Location.
		</xs:documentation>
	</xs:annotation>
	<xs:annotation>
		<xs:documentation>Modified: 13 Jun 2008 Version: 3.1.0  Author: Jean-Christophe Rossand (IATA).  
		Update compared to 3.0.1: Optional elements introduced:
		- In the transmission: IssuingOrganizationID, ReceivingOrganizationID, TestFlag, TransmissionData @Name
		- In the invoice message: InvoiceDeliveryCountryCode, SubItemInvoiceUOMFactor, SubItemTaxInvoiceUOMFactor and SubTaxInvoiceUOMFactor
		Element Version changed from AN10 to AN50, new version is: "IATA:FuelInvoiceV3.1.0"
		Amendment 20080818: Correction in TransmissionHeader (unnecessary field TransmissionID)
		Amendment 20080924: Correction in TransmissionHeader (unnecessary field TransmissionData)
		Amendment 20081029: Comment about schema location update corrected
		</xs:documentation>
	</xs:annotation>
	<xs:annotation>
		<xs:documentation>Modified: 26 Feb 2018 Version: 3.2.0  Author: Mark Johnson (EBITS).  
		Update compared to 3.1.0: 
			- Encoding amendment "UTF-8" in place of "UTF-16" to match other standards
			- Addition of DensityInformation to ItemQuantity allowing Temperature and Density Information to be added to Delivery Info (non-mandatory)
		</xs:documentation>
	</xs:annotation>
	<xs:annotation>
		<xs:documentation>Modified: 12 Mar 2018 Version: 3.2.1  Author: Chris Dodson (IATA).  
			Update compared to 3.2.0: 
			- imports changed to IATA file naming standard
			- version attribute added in header
		</xs:documentation>
	</xs:annotation>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceTransmission">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Defines an Invoice transmission file Required Node</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:complexType>
			<xs:sequence>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceTransmissionHeader"/>
				<xs:element ref="Invoice" maxOccurs="100000"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceTransmissionSmry"/>
			</xs:sequence>
		</xs:complexType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceTransmissionHeader">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Header Information node in the transmission.</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:complexType>
			<xs:sequence>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceTransmissionId"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceCreationDate"/>
				<xs:element ref="Version"/>
				<xs:element ref="IssuingOrganizationID" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="ReceivingOrganizationID" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="TestFlag" minOccurs="0"/>
			</xs:sequence>
		</xs:complexType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceTransmissionId" type="IATABDT:AN50Base">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Unique identifier for the file transmitted.</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceCreationDate" type="IATABDT:DTBase">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Date of creation of the invoice file</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="Version">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Current Version of Schema</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:simpleType>
			<xs:restriction base="IATABDT:AN50Base">
				<xs:enumeration value="IATA:FuelInvoiceV3.2.1"/>
			</xs:restriction>
		</xs:simpleType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="IssuingOrganizationID">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Identifies the organization sending the message</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:simpleType>
			<xs:restriction base="IATABDT:AN25Base"/>
		</xs:simpleType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="ReceivingOrganizationID">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Identifies the organization receiving the message</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:simpleType>
			<xs:restriction base="IATABDT:AN25Base"/>
		</xs:simpleType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="TestFlag">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Identifies if the file is a test file or not. 1: The transmission contains test data; 0: The transmission contains production data. 0 is assumed when not instantiated.</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:simpleType>
			<xs:restriction base="IATABDT:AN01Base">
				<xs:enumeration value="0"/>
				<xs:enumeration value="1"/>
			</xs:restriction>
		</xs:simpleType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="Invoice">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Required node for each invoice being transmitted</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:complexType>
			<xs:sequence>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceHeader"/>
				<xs:element ref="SubInvoiceHeader" maxOccurs="200"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceSummary"/>
			</xs:sequence>
		</xs:complexType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceHeader">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Invoice Header Details Once per Invoice</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:complexType>
			<xs:sequence>
				<xs:element ref="CustomerEntityID"/>
				<xs:element ref="IssuingEntityID"/>
				<xs:element ref="IssuingEntityName" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="IssuingEntityAffiliateName" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="IssuingEntityAffiliateNotes" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceNumber"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceIssueDate"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceType"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceDeliveryLocation"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceDeliveryCountryCode" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoicePaymentTermsType" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoicePaymentTermsDateBasis" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoicePaymentTermsDiscountPercent" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoicePaymentTermsDiscountDueDate" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoicePaymentTermsNetDueDate" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoicePaymentTermsNetDueDays" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoicePaymentTermsDescription" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="20"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceReferenceValue" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="12"/>
				<xs:element ref="TaxInvoiceNumber"/>
				<xs:element ref="TaxPointDate" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceTaxClause" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="10"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceCurrencyCode"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceCurrencyCodeLocal" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceCurrencyConversion" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceTotalAmount"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceTotalAmountLocal" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceDiscountAmount" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceDiscountAmountLocal" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceNotes" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="50"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceIDDetails" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="200"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceTaxes" minOccurs="0"/>
			</xs:sequence>
		</xs:complexType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="CustomerEntityID">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Identification Code to the receiving party</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:simpleType>
			<xs:restriction base="IATABDT:AN25Base"/>
		</xs:simpleType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="IssuingEntityID">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Identification Code of the issuing party</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:simpleType>
			<xs:restriction base="IATABDT:AN25Base"/>
		</xs:simpleType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="IssuingEntityName">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Name of Entity issuing the Invoice</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:simpleType>
			<xs:restriction base="IATABDT:AN50Base"/>
		</xs:simpleType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="IssuingEntityAffiliateName">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Name of affliate that the Issuing Entity is creating an invoice on behalf of the affliate</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:simpleType>
			<xs:restriction base="IATABDT:AN50Base"/>
		</xs:simpleType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="IssuingEntityAffiliateNotes" type="IATABDT:AN200Base">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Free form text to describe relationship of Issuing Entity and Affliate or background on the different entities for the issuer of the invoice and the "Remit To:" entity.</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceNumber">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Invoice Number</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:simpleType>
			<xs:restriction base="IATABDT:AN25Base"/>
		</xs:simpleType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceIssueDate" type="xs:date">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>InvoiceDate </xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceType">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Type of invoice to indicate original invoice or credit note. For the attribute InvoiceTransactionType use IATA Codes, Section H </xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:complexType>
			<xs:simpleContent>
				<xs:extension base="IATAFC:InvoiceTypeBase">
					<xs:attribute name="InvoiceTransactionType" type="IATAFC:InvoiceTransactionType" use="required"/>
				</xs:extension>
			</xs:simpleContent>
		</xs:complexType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceDeliveryLocation" type="IATABDT:AN20Base">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Delivery location of goods or services</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceDeliveryCountryCode" type="IATAFC:CountryCode">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Country Code Use IATA Codes, Section G </xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoicePaymentTermsType">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Code identifying type of payment terms</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:simpleType>
			<xs:restriction base="IATABDT:AN20Base"/>
		</xs:simpleType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoicePaymentTermsDateBasis" type="IATAFC:PaymentTermsDateBasis">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Code identifying date for basis of terms. Use IATA Codes, Section N </xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoicePaymentTermsDiscountPercent">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Discount Percent</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:simpleType>
			<xs:restriction base="IATABDT:D186Base"/>
		</xs:simpleType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoicePaymentTermsDiscountDueDate" type="IATABDT:DTBase">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Discount Due Date  (YYYY-MM-DD)</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoicePaymentTermsNetDueDate" type="IATABDT:DTBase">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Net Due Date  (YYYY-MM-DD)</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoicePaymentTermsNetDueDays">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Discount offer in days</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:simpleType>
			<xs:restriction base="xs:integer">
				<xs:totalDigits value="10"/>
				<xs:fractionDigits value="0"/>
			</xs:restriction>
		</xs:simpleType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoicePaymentTermsDescription">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Description of payment terms free form text</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:simpleType>
			<xs:restriction base="IATABDT:AN80Base"/>
		</xs:simpleType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceReferenceValue">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Reference Information Attribute: Reference type such as contract number, purchase order number, bill of lading, workorder or service orderUse IATA Codes, Section J </xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:complexType>
			<xs:simpleContent>
				<xs:extension base="IATABDT:AN35Base">
					<xs:attribute name="InvoiceReferenceType" type="IATAFC:InvoiceReferenceType" use="required"/>
				</xs:extension>
			</xs:simpleContent>
		</xs:complexType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="TaxInvoiceNumber">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>InvoiceNumber for Tax Jurisdiction</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:simpleType>
			<xs:restriction base="IATABDT:AN25Base"/>
		</xs:simpleType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="TaxPointDate" type="IATABDT:DTBase">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Date on which tax is due or calculated</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceTaxClause">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Free form tax notes</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:simpleType>
			<xs:restriction base="IATABDT:AN80Base"/>
		</xs:simpleType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceCurrencyCode" type="IATAFC:CurrencyCodeBase">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>ISO Standard Currency Code Use IATA Codes, Section C </xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceCurrencyCodeLocal" type="IATAFC:CurrencyCodeBase">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Local Currency Code (Standard ISO Code)</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceCurrencyConversion">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Describes how an amount in CurrencyFrom is converted into an amount in CurrencyTo</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:complexType>
			<xs:sequence>
				<xs:element ref="ConversionMechanism"/>
				<xs:element ref="CurrencyFrom"/>
				<xs:element ref="CurrencyTo"/>
				<xs:element ref="ExchangeRate"/>
			</xs:sequence>
		</xs:complexType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="ConversionMechanism">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Multiply or Divide</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:simpleType>
			<xs:restriction base="xs:string">
				<xs:enumeration value="M"/>
				<xs:enumeration value="D"/>
			</xs:restriction>
		</xs:simpleType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="CurrencyFrom">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Currency from which to convert</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:complexType>
			<xs:simpleContent>
				<xs:extension base="IATAFC:CurrencyCodeBase">
					<xs:attribute name="FactorFrom" use="required">
						<xs:simpleType>
							<xs:restriction base="xs:integer">
								<xs:totalDigits value="9"/>
								<xs:fractionDigits value="0"/>
							</xs:restriction>
						</xs:simpleType>
					</xs:attribute>
				</xs:extension>
			</xs:simpleContent>
		</xs:complexType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="CurrencyTo">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Currency to which to convert</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:complexType>
			<xs:simpleContent>
				<xs:extension base="IATAFC:CurrencyCodeBase">
					<xs:attribute name="FactorTo" use="required">
						<xs:simpleType>
							<xs:restriction base="xs:integer">
								<xs:totalDigits value="9"/>
								<xs:fractionDigits value="0"/>
							</xs:restriction>
						</xs:simpleType>
					</xs:attribute>
				</xs:extension>
			</xs:simpleContent>
		</xs:complexType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="ExchangeRate">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Exchange rate value</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:simpleType>
			<xs:restriction base="IATABDT:D186Base"/>
		</xs:simpleType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceTotalAmount" type="IATABDT:D182Base">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Total Amount Due on the Invoice (including InvoiceTax, fees and InvoiceFreight etc.)</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceTotalAmountLocal" type="IATABDT:D182Base">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Total Amount due on the Invoice in local currency.</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceDiscountAmount" type="IATABDT:D182Base">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Total Invoice Discount Amount</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceDiscountAmountLocal" type="IATABDT:D182Base">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Total Invoice discount amount in local currency.</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceNotes" type="IATABDT:AN200Base">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Free Form Notes</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceIDDetails">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Invoice ID node. Attribute: Identification Type Code. Such as Bill to, ship to , Remit to....Use IATA Codes, Section K </xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:complexType>
			<xs:sequence>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceIDVATRegistrationNumber"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceIDName1"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceIDName2" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceIDStreet1" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceIDStreet2" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceIDCity" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceIDState" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceIDCountryCode" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceIDPostalCode" minOccurs="0"/>
				<xs:element ref="InvoiceIDCustomField" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="99"/>
			</xs:sequence>
			<xs:attribute name="InvoiceIDType" type="IATAFC:InvoiceIDType" use="required"/>
		</xs:complexType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceIDVATRegistrationNumber" type="IATABDT:AN25Base">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>VAT or Other Tax Registration Number</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceIDName1" type="IATABDT:AN50Base">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Name related to the Invoice ID Type</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceIDName2" type="IATABDT:AN50Base">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Additonal name related to InvoiceIDType</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceIDStreet1" type="IATABDT:AN50Base">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Street Address</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceIDStreet2" type="IATABDT:AN50Base">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Street Address</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceIDCity" type="IATABDT:AN50Base">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>City</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceIDState" type="IATABDT:AN50Base">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>State/Province/Region/County</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceIDCountryCode" type="IATAFC:CountryCode">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Country Code Use IATA Codes, Section G </xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceIDPostalCode">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Postal Code</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:simpleType>
			<xs:restriction base="xs:string">
				<xs:maxLength value="9"/>
				<xs:minLength value="1"/>
			</xs:restriction>
		</xs:simpleType>
	</xs:element>
	<xs:element name="InvoiceIDCustomField">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation>Custom Field Attribute: Counter for the nodes. </xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:complexType>
